0..72 Comment "//! This source refuses a bare constructor name that two families share."
73..76 Comment "//!"
77..153 Comment "//! `Color` and `Light` each declare `Red`. The bare name selects no family,"
154..185 Comment "//! as a value or as a pattern."
186..189 Comment "//!"
